*Why choose a local team*

## Why Sunshine Coast schools book Rhythm Culture

Because we’re based on the coast, planning an incursion with us is simple. Getting to your school is easy, so we can fit in around your term calendar.

Also, every session is tailored to your students. So whether you need a small group workshop or a whole-school event, we’ll shape the program around your year levels and timetable.

As a result, Sunshine Coast schools book us for many different occasions:

- Harmony Week and cultural days.
- Music and performing arts programs.
- Whole-school events and special celebrations.
- Student wellbeing and team-building days.
- End-of-term celebrations and school retreats.
{% /column %}

