## Our school incursion programs

There are three programs to choose from. Each one suits primary and high school students, and no experience is needed.

{% columns layout="equal" align="top" %}
{% column %}
*Most popular*

### Drum Sing Dance

Students drum, sing and dance in one lively session. Then they bring it all together as one big ensemble.

[About Drum Sing Dance →](/drum-sing-dance-program/)
{% /column %}

{% column %}
*Music*

### African drumming

Every student plays a [djembe](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Djembe), so the whole class learns rhythms, call-and-response and ensemble playing.

[About the drumming workshop →](/school-incursions/#workshops)
{% /column %}

{% column %}
*Dance & performing arts*

### African dance

Students learn energetic West African moves. Live drumming can also be added for a bigger experience.

[About the dance workshop →](/school-incursions/#workshops)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /section %}

