{% section tone="dark" %}
## Booking a Sunshine Coast school incursion

1. **Request a quote:** First, send us your school, preferred dates and year levels.
2. **Plan together:** Then we suggest the best program and timings for your students.
3. **We drive to you:** On the day, our local team brings every drum and sets up in your space.
4. **Play as one:** Finally, the session ends with everyone playing together as one ensemble.
{% /section %}

{% section tone="grey" %}
## Sunshine Coast school incursions FAQs

{% faq %}
{% question title="Do you charge travel fees for Sunshine Coast schools?" %}
No. We’re based in Palmwoods, so there are no travel fees anywhere on the Sunshine Coast. In fact, we don’t charge travel fees anywhere in Australia.
{% /question %}

{% question title="Which areas of the Sunshine Coast do you visit?" %}
All of it. We visit schools all over the coast, from Noosa and Coolum to Kawana and Caloundra, as well as hinterland towns like Maleny, Nambour and Glass House Mountains.
{% /question %}

{% question title="Can you run sessions for the whole school in one day?" %}
Yes. We can run several sessions for different year levels, or bring everyone together for one big session. So just tell us your timetable, and we’ll plan around it.
{% /question %}

{% question title="Do your incursions link to the curriculum?" %}
Yes. Our programs support The Arts (Music and Dance) as well as cross-curriculum learning about cultures. For example, see [how our school incursions link to the curriculum](/school-incursions/#curriculum).
{% /question %}

{% question title="How do we book a Sunshine Coast school incursion?" %}
Simply fill in our quick quote form, or call 0434 585 992. Then we’ll come back to you with options and pricing for your school.
{% /question %}
{% /faq %}
{% /section %}

